  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7516ebc1e3af4144fb29ba9363e3ceab, type: 3}
  m_Name: BG0A
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Story
  dialogue:
  - dialogueLine: You were Knight, working for a Lord you admire.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Although the work was tough, and your death has nearly came multiple
      times due to countless battles, you've always managed to crawl your way back
      to life.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: 'And throughout everything, you never betrayed the code that supported
      you throughout it all: Chivalry, Honor, and Family.'
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Even so, after a fierce battle between another lord which chipped
      your sword and wounded your comrades, you decided to do your best to tend to
      them instead of going to battle.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: However, your Lord refused to quit. He decided that all livin 
      Knights, along with several peasants to raid the neighboring Lord, and get
      revenge for the ones your territory had lost.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Before you go off to battle, you say goodbye to your wife and children.
      Every battle may be your last, but this one was more reckless than ever. But
      avenging your comrades who had lost their lives was just as important.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: And so you went to battle. The battle was brutal, yet you stood
      firm, capturing and slaying elegantly with the techniques you had built up
      for decades.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: On the night of the battle, you and your comrades decided to camp
      just outside the opposing Lord's territory. You had already lost many, yet
      the group stayed strong.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: But in the corner of your eye, you saw a red glint. Afraid it was
      the torches of the enemy, you decided to explore the threat alone.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: And then, before you knew what had had happened...
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 1
      endDialogue: 1
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects:
      - effectType: 15
        intValue: 0
        floatValue: 0
        stringValue: 
        itemValue: {fileID: 0}
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
